00:24:23,240 --> 00:24:27,220
So in comparison, you just read, I think,

537
00:24:27,220 --> 00:24:29,480
like eight fixed offset integers.

538
00:24:29,480 --> 00:24:32,160
The 64-bit ones of them are kept at 48 bits.

539
00:24:32,160 --> 00:24:34,740
